541	     * The number of owners that may already exist for a business day before a create is flagged with
542	     * a bulk-signup warning. Once more than this many owners already carry the effective registration
543	     * date, the created owner's {@code bulkSignupWarning} is set to {@code true}.
544	     */
545	    private static final int BULK_SIGNUP_WARNING_THRESHOLD = 80;
