156	    /**
157	     * The leading {@code REGION} segment of the owner's {@code memberId}, i.e. the run of non-digit
158	     * characters before the 2-digit fiscal year. Returns {@code null} when the owner has no memberId
159	     * or the memberId has no leading region segment.
