223	     * owner (the household-capped value assigned on create) that stored value is returned; otherwise the
224	     * level is derived from membershipPoints via {@link #derivedMembershipLevel(Owner)}.
225	     */
226	    default @Nullable Integer membershipLevel(@Nullable Owner owner) {
